I use jumping frequently to get over traps, especially the trapdoors
in the castle, but also anywhere else I run into traps I don't want to
set off in narrow corridors.  Also sometimes to hop from one island to
another across water or lava.  It's much more convenient than
switching rings, or boots, or whatever else I'd otherwise need to do.

Jumping is also sometimes useful when there are a lot of monsters
about and I want to "get ahead" - to pick up a potion before someone
else does in a barracks, to eat a particular corpse before one of my
pets does, and so on.

